This repository is licensed per top-level directory. Each directory carries its
own LICENSE file with the controlling terms; this file is a map, not a grant
that overrides them. Where two licenses apply within one directory, the file
type decides (see protocol/ below).

  Directory    License                              Terms file
  ---------    -------                              ----------
  desktop/     GPL-3.0-only                          desktop/LICENSE
  ios/         MIT                                   ios/LICENSE
  android/     MIT                                   android/LICENSE
  protocol/    MIT — schema/code (*.proto, code)     protocol/LICENSE
               CC BY 4.0 — prose (*.md)              protocol/LICENSE-docs
  docs/        CC BY-SA 4.0                          docs/LICENSE
  spikes/      MIT — exploratory throwaway code, provided as-is

Repository metadata and tooling at the root — this file, CONTRIBUTING.md, and
the .github/ CI configuration — are provided under the MIT License, reproduced
below.

Contributions are accepted under the Developer Certificate of Origin and are
licensed inbound = outbound (under the license of the directory they touch).
